//   README.pyro.md and UPSTREAM.patch. prefix: the files' path in the patch, under a/ and b/.
// style: how a file's section is written (generate() below):
//   git-dirs   `git diff --no-index --no-prefix a b` run in the parent of the two trees.
//   git-repo   `git diff` in a checkout of the upstream (new files as `diff --git a/F b/F`).
//   blitz-dom  git's hunks (myers) without the function after `@@`; `diff --git a/F b/F`, `new file mode 100644` for a
//              new file, `deleted file mode 100644` for a deleted one (`git apply -R` needs it), `---`/`+++`, no
//              index line.
